ligned}{r}_{u}^{′} & =⟨\\frac{∂x}{∂u},\\,\\frac{∂y}{∂u},\\,\\frac{∂z}{∂u}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{∂}{∂u}(2\\left(u\\right)),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂u}(3\\left(v\\right)),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂u}(4\\left(u-{e}^{v}\\right))⟩ \\\\  & =⟨2,\\,0,\\,4⟩ \\\\ {r}_{v}^{′} & =⟨\\frac{∂x}{∂v},\\,\\frac{∂y}{∂v},\\,\\frac{∂z}{∂v}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{∂}{∂v}(2\\left(u\\right)),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂v}(3\\left(v\\right)),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂v}(4\\left(u-{e}^{v}\\right))⟩ \\\\  & =⟨0,\\,3,\\,- 4 e^{v}⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the fundamental vector product is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′} & =\\begin{vmatrix}i & j & k \\\\ 2\\left(1\\right) & 0 & 4\\left(1\\right) \\\\ 0 & 3\\left(1\\right) & 4\\left(-{e}^{v}\\right)\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  & =⟨\\begin{vmatrix}0 & 4\\left(1\\right) \\\\ 3\\left(1\\right) & 4\\left(-{e}^{v}\\right)\\end{vmatrix},\\,-\\begin{vmatrix}2\\left(1\\right) & 4\\left(1\\right) \\\\ 0 & 4\\left(-{e}^{v}\\right)\\end{vmatrix},\\,\\begin{vmatrix}2\\left(1\\right) & 0 \\\\ 0 & 3\\left(1\\right)\\end{vmatrix}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-12,\\,8 e^{v},\\,6⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["52fa7d03-36ca-5ec6-a545-028ec9a3e3b7"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "d5132c66-a16e-5aaf-8021-9cfcf9dae875" :answer/id #uuid "d5132c66-a16e-5aaf-8021-9cfcf9dae875" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨- 48 v^{2},\\,16 u,\\,96 u v^{2}⟩" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "f82660ec-1d20-5f98-a30b-893b20483f22" :answer/id #uuid "f82660ec-1d20-5f98-a30b-893b20483f22" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨0,\\,12 v^{2},\\,2⟩" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "a2e3ac65-4e72-576b-81d3-83baa3c9e6d4" :answer/id #uuid "a2e3ac65-4e72-576b-81d3-83baa3c9e6d4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨48 v^{2},\\,16 u,\\,- 96 u v^{2}⟩" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "7302147c-799a-53fc-9de8-45d235aa655f" :answer/id #uuid "7302147c-799a-53fc-9de8-45d235aa655f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨8 u,\\,0,\\,4⟩" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "c311f11d-ff39-5e16-a7cd-305794bdafae" :answer/id #uuid "c311f11d-ff39-5e16-a7cd-305794bdafae" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨- 48 v^{2},\\,- 16 u,\\,96 u v^{2}⟩" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "97d1543c-ce7e-5c30-9e63-bcf33b02c1b5" :answer-field/id #uuid "97d1543c-ce7e-5c30-9e63-bcf33b02c1b5" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["d5132c66-a16e-5aaf-8021-9cfcf9dae875" "f82660ec-1d20-5f98-a30b-893b20483f22" "a2e3ac65-4e72-576b-81d3-83baa3c9e6d4" "7302147c-799a-53fc-9de8-45d235aa655f" "c311f11d-ff39-5e16-a7cd-305794bdafae"] :answer-field/correct "c311f11d-ff39-5e16-a7cd-305794bdafae" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "34df8a07-4ac5-5db8-94ec-53489ab5c141" :question/id #uuid "34df8a07-4ac5-5db8-94ec-53489ab5c141" :question/problem "Find the fundamental vector product of the surface defined by the equations \n\n$$\nx=4\\left({u}^{2}+1\\right),\\,y=4\\left({v}^{3}+1\\right),\\,z=2\\left(2u+v\\right).\n$$" :question/worked-solution "For a surface with parametrization $r(u,v),$ the fundamental vector product is defined as ${r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}.$\n\nIn vector form, our surface has the equation \n\n$$\nr(u,v)=⟨4\\left({u}^{2}+1\\right),\\,4\\left({v}^{3}+1\\right),\\,2\\left(2u+v\\right)⟩.\n$$\n\nWe first compute the tangent vectors to the grid curves:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}_{u}^{′} & =⟨\\frac{∂x}{∂u},\\,\\frac{∂y}{∂u},\\,\\frac{∂z}{∂u}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{∂}{∂u}(4\\left({u}^{2}+1\\right)),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂u}(4\\left({v}^{3}+1\\right)),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂u}(2\\left(2u+v\\right))⟩ \\\\  & =⟨8 u,\\,0,\\,4⟩ \\\\ {r}_{v}^{′} & =⟨\\frac{∂x}{∂v},\\,\\frac{∂y}{∂v},\\,\\frac{∂z}{∂v}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{∂}{∂v}(4\\left({u}^{2}\\right)),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂v}(4\\left({v}^{3}+1\\right)),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂v}(2\\left(2u+v\\right))⟩ \\\\  & =⟨0,\\,12 v^{2},\\,2⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the fundamental vector product is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′} & =\\begin{vmatrix}i & j & k \\\\ 4\\left(2u\\right) & 0 & 2\\left(2\\right) \\\\ 0 & 4\\left(3{v}^{2}\\right) & 2\\left(1\\right)\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  & =⟨\\begin{vmatrix}0 & 2\\left(2\\right) \\\\ 4\\left(3{v}^{2}\\right) & 2\\left(1\\right)\\end{vmatrix},\\,-\\begin{vmatrix}4\\left(2u\\right) & 2\\left(2\\right) \\\\ 0 & 2\\left(1\\right)\\end{vmatrix},\\,\\begin{vmatrix}4\\left(2u\\right) & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4\\left(3{v}^{2}\\right)\\end{vmatrix}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨- 48 v^{2},\\,- 16 u,\\,96 u v^{2}⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["97d1543c-ce7e-5c30-9e63-bcf33b02c1b5"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "948274ad-00c2-576b-8a46-9c49f17fea14" :answer/id #uuid "948274ad-00c2-576b-8a46-9c49f17fea14" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨- 9 u \\cos{(u )} + 18 v^{2},\\,9 u - 9 v,\\,- 18 v + 9 \\cos{(u )}⟩" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "c99438fc-2a5a-57e6-8a6f-35fd0cb40dad" :answer/id #uuid "c99438fc-2a5a-57e6-8a6f-35fd0cb40dad" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨9 u \\cos{(u )} - 18 v^{2},\\,- 9 u + 9 v,\\,18 v - 9 \\cos{(u )}⟩" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "af4abca4-9c9c-5890-99b9-eab3686e51f1" :answer/id #uuid "af4abca4-9c9c-5890-99b9-eab3686e51f1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨3,\\,6 v,\\,3 u⟩" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "7c963dd3-a1f9-5682-99a3-17ca99265979" :answer/id #uuid "7c963dd3-a1f9-5682-99a3-17ca99265979" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨9 u \\cos{(u )} - 18 v^{2},\\,9 u - 9 v,\\,18 v - 9 \\cos{(u )}⟩" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "ccaccd12-671f-52c4-8b18-a8e1d1b6a31c" :answer/id #uuid "ccaccd12-671f-52c4-8b18-a8e1d1b6a31c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨3,\\,3 \\cos{(u )},\\,3 v⟩" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "0cf26bf8-7ae2-5ac3-aef1-b50aa10ab485" :answer-field/id #uuid "0cf26bf8-7ae2-5ac3-aef1-b50aa10ab485" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["948274ad-00c2-576b-8a46-9c49f17fea14" "c99438fc-2a5a-57e6-8a6f-35fd0cb40dad" "af4abca4-9c9c-5890-99b9-eab3686e51f1" "7c963dd3-a1f9-5682-99a3-17ca99265979" "ccaccd12-671f-52c4-8b18-a8e1d1b6a31c"] :answer-field/correct "c99438fc-2a5a-57e6-8a6f-35fd0cb40dad" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "a36ce165-471f-570d-9650-640cec5623fe" :question/id #uuid "a36ce165-471f-570d-9650-640cec5623fe" :question/problem "Find the fundamental vector product of the surface defined by the equations\n\n$x = 3\\left(u + v\\right), y = 3\\left(v^{2} + \\sin u\\right), z = 3\\left(uv\\right)$." :question/worked-solution "For a surface with parametrization $r(u,v),$ the fundamental vector product is defined as ${r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}.$\n\nIn vector form, our surface has the equation \n\n$$\nr(u,v)=⟨3 u + 3 v,\\,3 v^{2} + 3 \\sin{(u )},\\,3 u v⟩.\n$$\n\nWe first compute the tangent vectors to the grid curves:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}_{u}^{′} & =⟨\\frac{∂x}{∂u},\\,\\frac{∂y}{∂u},\\,\\frac{∂z}{∂u}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{∂}{∂u}(3 u + 3 v),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂u}(3 v^{2} + 3 \\sin{(u )}),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂u}(3 u v)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨3,\\,3 \\cos{(u )},\\,3 v⟩ \\\\ {r}_{v}^{′} & =⟨\\frac{∂x}{∂v},\\,\\frac{∂y}{∂v},\\,\\frac{∂z}{∂v}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{∂}{∂v}(3 u + 3 v),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂v}(3 v^{2} + 3 \\sin{(u )}),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂v}(3 u v)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨3,\\,6 v,\\,3 u⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the fundamental vector product is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′} & =\\begin{vmatrix}i & j & k \\\\ 3 & 3 \\cos{(u )} & 3 v \\\\ 3 & 6 v & 3 u\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  & =⟨\\begin{vmatrix}3 \\cos{(u )} & 3 v \\\\ 6 v & 3 u\\end{vmatrix},\\,-\\begin{vmatrix}3 & 3 v \\\\ 3 & 3 u\\end{vmatrix},\\,\\begin{vmatrix}3 & 3 \\cos{(u )} \\\\ 3 & 6 v\\end{vmatrix}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨(3 \\cos{(u )})(3 u)-(3 v)(6 v),\\,-[(3)(3 u)-(3 v)(3)],\\,(3)(6 v)-(3 \\cos{(u )})(3)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨9 u \\cos{(u )} - 18 v^{2},\\,- 9 u + 9 v,\\,18 v - 9 \\cos{(u )}⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["0cf26bf8-7ae2-5ac3-aef1-b50aa10ab485"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "8f662bdf-3426-541b-aeae-8f73c454cac5" :answer/id #uuid "8f662bdf-3426-541b-aeae-8f73c454cac5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨- 48 v^{2},\\,12 u,\\,72 u v^{2}⟩" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "b7bf49b0-96d5-5f6a-bf2a-ab30c93bed0c" :answer/id #uuid "b7bf49b0-96d5-5f6a-bf2a-ab30c93bed0c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨0,\\,12 v^{2},\\,2⟩" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "4ebc0dc8-e1eb-526d-b156-67f24bff1e0b" :answer/id #uuid "4ebc0dc8-e1eb-526d-b156-67f24bff1e0b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨6 u,\\,0,\\,4⟩" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "3158d5a7-3a0d-564b-b6fb-2802c49578ac" :answer/id #uuid "3158d5a7-3a0d-564b-b6fb-2802c49578ac" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨- 48 v^{2},\\,- 12 u,\\,72 u v^{2}⟩" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "9ac7215a-1e75-5bca-9b78-c47a51cd04cd" :answer/id #uuid "9ac7215a-1e75-5bca-9b78-c47a51cd04cd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨48 v^{2},\\,12 u,\\,- 72 u v^{2}⟩" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "90974337-909a-5a06-b301-97712683285d" :answer-field/id #uuid "90974337-909a-5a06-b301-97712683285d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["8f662bdf-3426-541b-aeae-8f73c454cac5" "b7bf49b0-96d5-5f6a-bf2a-ab30c93bed0c" "4ebc0dc8-e1eb-526d-b156-67f24bff1e0b" "3158d5a7-3a0d-564b-b6fb-2802c49578ac" "9ac7215a-1e75-5bca-9b78-c47a51cd04cd"] :answer-field/correct "3158d5a7-3a0d-564b-b6fb-2802c49578ac" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "079d695e-b3a6-59aa-920c-1ff665e1082b" :question/id #uuid "079d695e-b3a6-59aa-920c-1ff665e1082b" :question/problem "Find the fundamental vector product of the surface defined by the equations \n\n$$\nx=3\\left({u}^{2}+1\\right),\\,y=4\\left({v}^{3}+1\\right),\\,z=2\\left(2u+v\\right).\n$$" :question/worked-solution "For a surface with parametrization $r(u,v),$ the fundamental vector product is defined as ${r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}.$\n\nIn vector form, our surface has the equation \n\n$$\nr(u,v)=⟨3\\left({u}^{2}+1\\right),\\,4\\left({v}^{3}+1\\right),\\,2\\left(2u+v\\right)⟩.\n$$\n\nWe first compute the tangent vectors to the grid curves:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}_{u}^{′} & =⟨\\frac{∂x}{∂u},\\,\\frac{∂y}{∂u},\\,\\frac{∂z}{∂u}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{∂}{∂u}(3\\left({u}^{2}+1\\right)),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂u}(4\\left({v}^{3}+1\\right)),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂u}(2\\left(2u+v\\right))⟩ \\\\  & =⟨6 u,\\,0,\\,4⟩ \\\\ {r}_{v}^{′} & =⟨\\frac{∂x}{∂v},\\,\\frac{∂y}{∂v},\\,\\frac{∂z}{∂v}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{∂}{∂v}(3\\left({u}^{2}\\right)),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂v}(4\\left({v}^{3}+1\\right)),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂v}(2\\left(2u+v\\right))⟩ \\\\  & =⟨0,\\,12 v^{2},\\,2⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the fundamental vector product is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′} & =\\begin{vmatrix}i & j & k \\\\ 3\\left(2u\\right) & 0 & 2\\left(2\\right) \\\\ 0 & 4\\left(3{v}^{2}\\right) & 2\\left(1\\right)\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  & =⟨\\begin{vmatrix}0 & 2\\left(2\\right) \\\\ 4\\left(3{v}^{2}\\right) & 2\\left(1\\right)\\end{vmatrix},\\,-\\begin{vmatrix}3\\left(2u\\right) & 2\\left(2\\right) \\\\ 0 & 2\\left(1\\right)\\end{vmatrix},\\,\\begin{vmatrix}3\\left(2u\\right) & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4\\left(3{v}^{2}\\right)\\end{vmatrix}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨- 48 v^{2},\\,- 12 u,\\,72 u v^{2}⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["90974337-909a-5a06-b301-97712683285d"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "generator" :question-generator/id #uuid "415c4d0e-413b-5fc2-8241-ef6a11198248" :question-generator/script "generate/scratch/17592186119887.py"} [:db/add 17592186119887 :knowledge-point/question-generator "generator"] {:db/id 17592186119887 :knowledge-point/questions ["5f82fba6-89f1-5c94-8cc8-c031a913d71e" "1f7b80e6-fd6c-56fc-be8d-0adb41e9046a" "c43bafbb-27d1-589d-9395-34d1fb53b842" "f5c049c6-8f99-5422-a42e-c9b464f4ec2b